			<attacks>
				<description><![CDATA[Arcane Firearm: You can use this dagger as an Arcane Firearm for your level 5 Artillerist feature, allowing you to add 1d8 to one damage roll of any spell you cast through it. That damage will always be dealt as frost damage.

Frostbite Infusion: When a creature takes damage from a spell you cast using this dagger as a focus, they take an additional +2 frost damage.]]></description>
				<attack identifier="" name="Firebolt" range="120 ft" attack="+8 vs AC" damage="2d10 fire + 1d8+2 cold" displayed="true">
					<description><![CDATA[Evocation Cantrip V, S]]></description>
				</attack>
				<attack identifier="" name="Green Flame Blade" range="5 ft" attack="On attack" damage="On hit, deal 1d8 fire to target, deal 1d8 + 5 fire to additional target." displayed="true">
					<description><![CDATA[On a hit you can cause green fire to leap from the target to a different creature of your choice that you can see within 5 feet of it.]]></description>
				</attack>
				<attack identifier="f65a2eff-9176-4077-a30b-16301e4d20b9" name="Frostbite Shard Dagger" range="5 ft" attack="+7 vs AC" damage="1d4+4 piercing + 1d4 cold" displayed="true" ability="Dexterity">
					<description><![CDATA[Spell Focus:
Arcane Firearm:
Frostbite Infusion]]></description>
				</attack>
			</attacks>
			<backstory><![CDATA[Lilly Glimmergear’s Story (The Inventive Artillerist)

Lilly Glimmergear was born in Deepforge Hollow, a bustling svirfneblin city deep in the Underdark, known for its intricate machinery and arcane inventions. Her mother, Poots Glimmergear, was a famous artificer and adventurer who inspired Lilly from a young age. Lilly grew up surrounded by the hum of machinery and magical devices, quickly developing a love for tinkering.

By age five, Lilly had built her first functional gadget, impressing both her mother and her community. Recognizing her potential, her mother enrolled her in Glimmerspire Academy of Artifice, a prestigious institution in Deepforge Hollow. There, Lilly mastered the art of blending magic with technology, excelling in mechanical engineering and arcane infusions.

On her seventh birthday, her mother entrusted her with the Essence Sphere, a unique device that holds the energy of Pikachu (Spark Fox), a lost companion from Poots’ adventuring days. Lilly’s quest became clear: restore Pikachu’s corporeal form. Determined to fulfill this responsibility, Lilly left the Underdark to find Ursa Catchum, the son of her mother’s former ally, Ash. She believed Ursa, with his connection to magical creatures, could help her unlock the secrets of the Essence Sphere.

On her journey, Lilly encountered Stabby Sharpblade, an adventurous goblin monk, and together with Ursa, they formed an unlikely adventuring party. With her inventive mind, loyal friends, and the Essence Sphere in hand, Lilly embarks on a journey to solve the mysteries of Pikachu’s energy and uncover the larger planar disturbances tied to magical creatures.]]></backstory>
			<background-trinket>Essence Sphere containing the energy of Pikachu</background-trinket>
			<background-traits>Inventive and Curious: Lilly is naturally inquisitive and loves to tinker. She’s always coming up with new ideas, gadgets, and ways to solve problems. Her curiosity often leads her to explore unknown areas or experiment with new designs. “Why settle for what’s already been made when you can create something better?</background-traits>
			<background-ideals>Creativity: Lilly believes that creativity is the key to solving any problem. She’s always looking for new and inventive ways to improve things and believes that thinking outside the box is the best way forward. “There’s always a new way to make something better.”</background-ideals>
			<background-bonds>Her Companions: Lilly has a strong bond with her adventuring companions, Ursa and Stabby. She relies on their friendship and support, and in return, she is fiercely loyal to them. "Together, we’ll solve these mysteries and prove ourselves."</background-bonds>
			<background-flaws>Lilly can be impatient, especially when things don’t go according to her carefully thought-out plans. She’s used to quickly solving problems with her inventions and may grow frustrated when faced with obstacles that take time to overcome. “Why isn’t this working already?”</background-flaws>
			<background>
				<feature name="Scavenger's Eye">
					<description><![CDATA[Lilly can easily identify useful components in her surroundings, whether from broken-down machinery, discarded tools, or even magical items. When exploring, she can spot materials that others might overlook, which she can use in her tinkering projects.]]></description>
				</feature>
			</background>
			<organization>
				<name>Glimmerspire Academy of Artifice</name>
				<symbol>C:\Users\jhffm\OneDrive\Documents\5e Character Builder\gallery\symbols\glimmerspire academy of artificeartifice academy symbol.png</symbol>
				<allies><![CDATA[Ursa Catchum – A 7-year-old human druid of the stars, son of Ash Catchum, and one of Lilly's closest companions. Ursa shares her connection to magical creatures and carries the enchanted potatoes, making him essential to Lilly’s quest.
Stabby Sharpblade – An 8-year-old goblin monk with a chaotic and adventurous spirit. Stabby is fiercely loyal to Lilly and Ursa, providing both comic relief and combat prowess in their journey.
Poots Glimmergear – Lilly’s mother, a renowned artificer who gave Lilly the Essence Sphere and set her on her quest to restore Pikachu. Though not physically present, Poots remains a key influence in Lilly’s life.]]></allies>
			</organization>
			<additional-features><![CDATA[1. Tinkerer’s Touch
Mechanical Ingenuity: Lilly can craft small mechanical devices or repair broken ones with minimal materials.
Quick Fix: She can quickly restore damaged gadgets or tools to working condition.

2. Arcane Inventor
Arcane Infusions: Lilly can temporarily enchant items, such as weapons or armor, with magical abilities.
Planar Energy Knowledge: Her research into planar energies helps her manipulate them for her inventions.

3. Resourceful Scavenger
Scavenger’s Eye: Lilly can find useful materials in her environment to create or fix devices.
Field Repairs: She can make temporary repairs to broken equipment in the field.

4. Essence Sphere Mastery
Energy Containment: Lilly can capture and store motes of energy from magical creatures in the Essence Sphere.
Essence Manipulation: She is learning to unlock the power of the Essence Sphere to restore Pikachu’s form.]]></additional-features>
