					<element type="List" name="Defining Event" requiredLevel="1" checksum="6b2f6060" isList="true" registered="10">Recruited into a lord’s army, I rose to leadership and was commended for my heroism.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Personality Trait" requiredLevel="1" number="1" checksum="5dc15eb8" isList="true" registered="6">Thinking is for other people. I prefer action.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Personality Trait" requiredLevel="1" number="2" checksum="c4c80f02" isList="true" registered="2">If someone is in trouble, I’m always ready to lend help.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Ideal" requiredLevel="1" checksum="e2cdfd17" isList="true" registered="4">Might. If I become strong, I can take what I want— what I deserve. (Evil)</element>
					<element type="List" name="Bond" requiredLevel="1" checksum="b6629a79" isList="true" registered="3">A proud noble once gave me a horrible beating, and I will take my revenge on any bully I encounter.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Flaw" requiredLevel="1" checksum="09129239" isList="true" registered="2">I’m convinced of the significance of my destiny, and blind to my shortcomings and the risk of failure.</element>
