					<notes>Spell Focus: This dagger can be used as a spellcasting focus for your artificer spells.
Arcane Firearm: You can use this dagger as an Arcane Firearm for your level 5 Artillerist feature, allowing you to add 1d8 to one damage roll of any spell you cast through it. That damage will always be dealt as frost damage.
Frostbite Infusion: When a creature takes damage from a spell you cast using this dagger as a focus, they take an additional +2 frost damage.</notes>
